    {
      "id": "43340642",
      "title": "Handling \"Not Found\" Errors & Showing \"Not Found\" Pages",
      "lectureOrder": 139,
      "videoOrder": 129,
      "sourceHash": "cd68a168403768ad9d43308417626bd48513b13eb682dc065d187ff21f95d0ff",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.88,
          "en": "Now besides improving the markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.88,
          "end": 7.47,
          "en": "and styling, there's one other thing we might want to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.47,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "with this basic application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 14.07,
          "en": "We might handle situations where visitors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.07,
          "end": 17.912,
          "en": "users of this website try to visit pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.912,
          "end": 22.74,
          "en": "or request news articles that don't exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.74,
          "end": 26.04,
          "en": "And we can do that by adding another special file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.04,
          "end": 30.85,
          "en": "to this project, the not-found.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.13,
          "end": 35.25,
          "en": "And this is a file that allows you to set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 35.25,
          "end": 37.23,
          "en": "some not found page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.23,
          "end": 40.05,
          "en": "some content that will be shown on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.05,
          "end": 43.53,
          "en": "if some page or resource is not found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.53,
          "end": 46.958,
          "en": "And you can add such a not-found.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.958,
          "end": 51.84,
          "en": "anywhere in your app folder, including in nested folders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.84,
          "end": 55.14,
          "en": "to have a route specific not found fallback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.14,
          "end": 57.54,
          "en": "but here I'm setting it up at the root level",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.54,
          "end": 61.92,
          "en": "of the app folder so that I catch any not found errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.92,
          "end": 66.92,
          "en": "thrown from anywhere in this application or this website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.38,
          "end": 69.36,
          "en": "Now in this not-found.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.36,
          "end": 72.81,
          "en": "we should then export a component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.81,
          "end": 77.07,
          "en": "the NotFoundPage component function, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 77.07,
          "end": 79.14,
          "en": "and it's then up to you which kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 79.14,
          "end": 81.51,
          "en": "of fallback content you wanna show here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.51,
          "end": 85.74,
          "en": "Here I'll return a div with an id of error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.74,
          "end": 89.313,
          "en": "which will simply make sure that it's stalled appropriately.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 93.63300000000001,
          "en": "And I'll add a h1 tag where I'll say Not Found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 94.62,
          "end": 98.16,
          "en": "And below that maybe a paragraph where we could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 98.16,
          "end": 102.68299999999999,
          "en": "the requested resource could not be found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 104.07,
          "end": 105.15299999999999,
          "en": "Something like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 107.07,
          "end": 109.882,
          "en": "With that, if you save that file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.882,
          "end": 114.882,
          "en": "if you try to enter some page that doesn't exist like /abc,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 115.013,
          "end": 118.083,
          "en": "you'll see that not found content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 122.16,
          "en": "Now that's some general not found content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 122.16,
          "end": 125.19,
          "en": "a general not found page that will be shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 130.14,
          "en": "whenever a not found error occurs anywhere on this website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 130.14,
          "end": 132.57,
          "en": "We could also copy this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 132.57,
          "end": 136.834,
          "en": "and set up a more specific not-found.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 136.834,
          "end": 139.5,
          "en": "for a nested path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 139.5,
          "end": 142.743,
          "en": "For example, here in this news slug folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 144.09,
          "end": 147.42000000000002,
          "en": "this would allow us to set up some fallback content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 147.42000000000002,
          "end": 150.18,
          "en": "that should be shown if an article isn't found,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 150.18,
          "end": 152.7,
          "en": "if a news item isn't found.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 152.7,
          "end": 156.3,
          "en": "Therefore, in that nested not-found.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 156.3,
          "end": 159.273,
          "en": "I'll rename this function to NewsNotFound.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 164.85,
          "en": "Though of course this name doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 164.85,
          "end": 168.66,
          "en": "And I'll keep the structure, but I'll change the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 168.66,
          "end": 172.05,
          "en": "or I'll change the text in this paragraph to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 172.05,
          "end": 174.39,
          "en": "And I'll say, unfortunately,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 174.39,
          "end": 178.68,
          "en": "we could not find the requested article.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 178.68,
          "end": 179.883,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 182.37,
          "end": 187.2,
          "en": "Now the idea is that if we now try to visit an article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 187.2,
          "end": 191.34,
          "en": "that does not exist, like /news/abc,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 191.34,
          "end": 193.32,
          "en": "we get this custom fallback,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 193.32,
          "end": 195.66,
          "en": "but as you see, that's not happening here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 195.66,
          "end": 198.243,
          "en": "Instead, I get some runtime error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 199.62,
          "end": 200.91,
          "en": "And we're getting that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 200.91,
          "end": 204.03,
          "en": "because of course NextJS doesn't really understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 204.03,
          "end": 206.85,
          "en": "whether an article exists or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 206.85,
          "end": 210.39,
          "en": "In this slug page.js file, we simply try",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 210.39,
          "end": 213.84,
          "en": "to find an article for the provided slug.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 213.84,
          "end": 216.96,
          "en": "So for the slug that was in the URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 216.96,
          "end": 219.96,
          "en": "and well, if that yields undefined here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 219.96,
          "end": 221.97,
          "en": "we'll simply run into some errors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 221.97,
          "end": 226.143,
          "en": "but we won't technically generate a not found error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 227.55,
          "end": 229.95,
          "en": "To do that, we should add an extra if check here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 229.95,
          "end": 234.20499999999998,
          "en": "and check if not newsItem, so if that is undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 234.20499999999998,
          "end": 237.885,
          "en": "and in that case you can call a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 237.885,
          "end": 242.176,
          "en": "that's provided by NextJS, the notFound function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 242.176,
          "end": 246.243,
          "en": "that should be imported from next/navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 247.98,
          "end": 249.69,
          "en": "When you call this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 249.69,
          "end": 253.26,
          "en": "you'll trigger such a not found error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 253.26,
          "end": 255.51,
          "en": "and NextJS will then handle that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 255.51,
          "end": 259.623,
          "en": "by showing the closest not found fallback content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 261.39,
          "end": 263.76,
          "en": "So with that, if you save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 263.76,
          "end": 267.84,
          "en": "if you now reload for /news/abc,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 267.84,
          "end": 271.17,
          "en": "you see you are getting this news article fallback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 271.17,
          "end": 273.93,
          "en": "and that's now the behavior we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 273.93,
          "end": 277.683,
          "en": "And with that, we're now also handling these situations.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
